  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub013_sister_01",
      "hash": "26f68ca277e78a2c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\c\\n想不想知道\\n你的宝可梦喜不喜欢你？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub013_sister_02",
      "hash": "26f68fa277e78f45",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\c\\n想不想知道\\n你的宝可梦喜不喜欢你？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub013_sister_03",
      "hash": "26f68ea277e78d92",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要训练家用心培育宝可梦，\\n宝可梦也会非常非常喜欢\\r\\n自己的训练家哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub013_sister_04",
      "hash": "26f689a277e78513",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那么就让我们看看\\n[VAR PKNICK(0001)]的情况吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub013_sister_05",
      "hash": "26f688a277e78360",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看来[VAR PKNICK(0001)]它真的\\n非常！非常！非～常喜欢你呢！\\c\\n你们互相都非常信任对方吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub013_sister_06",
      "hash": "26f68ba277e78879",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你的[VAR PKNICK(0001)]\\n非常喜欢你噢！\\c\\n它说它想要一直和你在一起呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub013_sister_07",
      "hash": "26f68aa277e786c6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看来[VAR PKNICK(0001)]\\n挺喜欢你的噢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub013_sister_08",
      "hash": "26f695a277e79977",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "它和你的关系变友好了！\\n接下去也要保持这个状态噢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub013_sister_09",
      "hash": "26f694a277e797c4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "它与你更亲近了一点呐！\\n这是个不错的势态噢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub013_sister_10",
      "hash": "26f307a277e47256",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你和它才认识不久吗？\\n期待你们今后的发展！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub013_sister_11",
      "hash": "26f308a277e47409",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你难不成总是让它\\n在对战中晕厥吧……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub013_sister_12",
      "hash": "26f305a277e46ef0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "糟糕！你怎么能放着它不管呢？\\n快去宝可梦中心治疗啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_woman1_01_p11_t001_r0201",
      "hash": "d543d023df5a8e8d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
